OL,5,G2320 Long Lost Family
OL,6,     FAvril was 15 when she placed her
OL,7,     Fdaughter for adoption in 1964. She
OL,8,     Fhas carried the pain of that
OL,9,     Fseparation with her since, and now
OL,10,     Fshe is dreaming of finally seeing
OL,11,     Fher again. Davina McCall and Nicky
OL,12,     FCampbell also investigate the case
OL,13,     Fof Marie, who was raised by her
OL,14,     Fgrandparents and has never known
OL,15,     Fher father. As a train conductor,
OL,16,     Fshe meets strangers every day and
OL,17,     Fwonders whether they could be
OL,18,     Frelated to her. She now yearns for
OL,19,     Fanswers
